{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Kashaev","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Kashaev","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.PhiQPiece"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L96-L102","doc":"The piece volume is non-negative — a genuine hyperbolic volume,\ndischarged by the instance field `pieceVol_nonneg`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.pieceVolume","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L78-L94","doc":"The hyperbolic volume of a Φ_q-piece `K_S`, lifted from the\ntypeclass.  This is the canonical bridge between the abstract\n`SubLink.hypVolume` field on the geometry side and the typeclass\n`VolumeConjecture.hypVolume` on the analysis side: any concrete\ninstance of `VolumeConjecture` populates a real value.\n\nThe per-piece value is now supplied by the `VolumeConjecture`\ninstance via the `pieceVol` field (populated by the SnapPy bridge\nlayer for concrete knot families); this definition is the thin\naccessor.  Callers never see a placeholder masquerading as a genuine\nS-dependent piece volume — an instance must provide a real value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.pieceVol_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.pieceVol_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L76-L76","doc":"Piece volumes are non-negative (each is a genuine hyperbolic volume). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.pieceVol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.pieceVol","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L74-L74","doc":"The hyperbolic volume of a Φ_q-piece `K_S` (the sub-link selected\nby the smoothing set `S`).  Supplied by the instance (the SnapPy\nbridge layer for concrete knot families); abstract here so callers\nnever see a placeholder masquerading as a genuine S-dependent value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kvc_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kvc_holds","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L69-L69","doc":"**The conjecture itself**: the Kashaev limit equals the\nhyperbolic volume.  This is the field that plays the role\nof `sorry` for KVC. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L65-L65","doc":"Hyperbolic volume is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kashaevLimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.kashaevLimit","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The Kashaev asymptotic limit `2π · lim_N log|J_N(K)| / N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.hypVolume","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Hyperbolic volume of `S³ \\ K_β`, with the convention that\nnon-hyperbolic complements contribute zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Kashaev.VolumeConjecture","kind":"class","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Kashaev.lean#L39-L76","doc":"**Kashaev Volume Conjecture (axiomatised).**\n\nEncodes the assertion that the hyperbolic volume of `S³ \\ K`\nequals the Kashaev limit `2π · lim_N log|J_N(K)| / N` of the\ncolored Jones polynomial.\n\nAny instance of this class supplies:\n- `hypVolume β` — the hyperbolic volume of the complement of the\n  closure of `β` (zero when the complement is not hyperbolic).\n- `kashaevLimit β` — the asymptotic limit of the colored Jones\n  polynomial.\n- `kvc_holds β` — the conjecture itself, identifying the two.\n\nThe `kvc_holds` field is the **conjectural input**: providing it\nis the role of mathematicians (not Lean).  Downstream theorems\nconsuming `[VolumeConjecture q]` are conditional on it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:kashaev-volume-conjecture","label":"conj:kashaev-volume-conjecture","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/kashaev-volume-conjecture.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}